mission "The Black Fleet Rises"
    name "The Black Fleet Rises"
    description "Sail to the Windward Cays, sink three of Vane's scouts, then reach Port Azure to report to Commodore Bonny."
    destination "Port Azure"
    lead "Nell turns the broken compass in her hand. “Commodore Bonny has gone to Isla Verde to gather the free captains and watch the Windward Cays. She asked me to send you if the compass ever pointed that way. You will find her near the eastern quay.”"
    source "Isla Verde"
    reward 720
    objective kills 3
    battlefield "The Windward Cays" 7350 2050
    enemy "The Ragged Crown"
    enemy "The Salt Widow"
    enemy "The Crimson Gull"
    speaker offer "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker visit "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    speaker complete "Commodore Anne Bonny"
    to offer
        has "The Compass of Dead Man's Cay: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `A woman in a weather-beaten red coat stands on the end of the quay. Her crew are loading powder into a pair of armed sloops. She introduces herself as Commodore Anne Bonny, elected commander of the free captains.`
            `"Nell found the lagoon. Vane's scouts are already carrying word to his fleet. The three raiders are marked on this chart in the Windward Cays. Find them and send them to the bottom, then return to Port Azure. I want your report before we sail for the lagoon."`
            choice
                `"I'll hunt the scouts. They won't reach the lagoon."`
                    goto accept_job
                `"What happens when the main fleet sails?"`
                    goto details
                `"I did not sign on to fight a war."`
                    goto decline_job
            label details
                `Bonny folds her arms. "Then we meet them together. Every captain who joins us will take a station at the entrance to the lagoon. But if Vane's scouts bring him word that we are coming, he will choose the time and place of the battle. I would rather choose it myself."`
                choice
                    `"I'll buy us that time. Three ships, no more."`
                        goto accept_job
                    `"I will keep my ship out of it."`
                        goto decline_job
            label accept_job
                `Bonny offers her forearm. "Good. Keep your distance until their broadsides are spent, then turn across their bows. Make every shot count."`
                accept
            label decline_job
                `Bonny nods. "No captain should be forced into another's war. But Vane will not ask before he comes for you."`
                close
    on accept
        log "Accepted Commodore Bonny's request. Sink three of Vane's raiders before they can report to the fleet."
    on visit
        conversation
            `You reach Port Azure with the scouts scattered. Commodore Bonny is waiting on the quay; she wants your report before the free captains make their final move.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `A succession of smoke columns marks the places where the raiders went down. At Port Azure, Bonny receives the news without smiling.`
            `"That buys us a little time. Vane has a heavy ship at the centre of his fleet, and every gun in these waters seems to be pointed at it. We need to take away its escorts before we can face it."`
            `She taps the chart. "When you are ready, we will strike at the lagoon itself."`
        log "Vane's scouts have been scattered. Commodore Bonny is preparing the final assault on Dead Man's Cay."
